 "segments": [
  {
   "segment": 1,
   "file": 1,
   "start": 4.415,
   "end": 13.608,
   "seconds": 9.193,
   "text": "I am Adrian, founder of Apply Arc, a UK job search startup that existed before this hackathon. Everything here was built during it on metamodels."
  },
  {
   "segment": 2,
   "file": 1,
   "start": 16.633,
   "end": 25.074,
   "seconds": 8.441,
   "text": "A real console job advert says, using AI, please follow our guidance to ensure your application reflects your own knowledge and experience."
  },
  {
   "segment": 3,
   "file": 1,
   "start": 28.94,
   "end": 37.347,
   "seconds": 8.407,
   "text": "Anna is fictional. Her problem is real. Three years in a lead's care home, work in English every day, and a form that once written English."
  },
  {
   "segment": 4,
   "file": 1,
   "start": 41.276,
   "end": 43.381,
   "seconds": 2.104,
   "text": "She said in Portuguese"
  },
  {
   "segment": 5,
   "file": 1,
   "start": 52.1,
   "end": 59.154,
   "seconds": 7.054,
   "text": "News, voice, transcribe. Write it down, life-keeping her English care words in English. She checks her words first."
  },
  {
   "segment": 6,
   "file": 1,
   "start": 62.333,
   "end": 72.51,
   "seconds": 10.177,
   "text": "Museu underturns her words into facts. Each one quotes her exact Portuguese, quotes jackets word for word. The English meaning sits underneath. She confirms both."
  },
  {
   "segment": 7,
   "file": 1,
   "start": 75.72,
   "end": 82.501,
   "seconds": 6.781,
   "text": "Wunder checks the concert endpoints and find the one she didn't cover. Dictating in respect, it asks in Portuguese."
  },
  {
   "segment": 8,
   "file": 1,
   "start": 87.217,
   "end": 98.446,
   "seconds": 11.229,
   "text": "Wonder draft her supporting evidence in a short letter in English. Every factual sentence cites a fact she confirmed. In a second Wonder call, check it again her Portuguese."
  },
  {
   "segment": 9,
   "file": 1,
   "start": 101.293,
   "end": 108.508,
   "seconds": 7.216,
   "text": "Then she remembers only two of her three years, three years, one night, she said once."
  },
  {
   "segment": 10,
   "file": 1,
   "start": 113.174,
   "end": 122.385,
   "seconds": 9.211,
   "text": "Wanda spots the contradiction and asks which is right. She picks the correction. Only the sentence that cites the old factory will open in more documents."
  },
  {
   "segment": 11,
   "file": 1,
   "start": 124.964,
   "end": 135.881,
   "seconds": 10.918,
   "text": "Nothing gets submitted for her. The Pakistan is not submitted. The employer gets one page where every factual sentence opens her Portuguese words."
  },
  {
   "segment": 12,
   "file": 1,
   "start": 138.771,
   "end": 149.66,
   "seconds": 10.889,
   "text": "What META did, step by step, model hosted META request IDs, both models are weeks old, a verifier rechecks the record without calling a model."
  },
  {
   "segment": 13,
   "file": 1,
   "start": 153.094,
   "end": 162.195,
   "seconds": 9.1,
   "text": "The same loop runs on meta open weights, use spark open on model, so care provider choose weight runs."
  },
  {
   "segment": 14,
   "file": 1,
   "start": 165.123,
   "end": 175.339,
   "seconds": 10.216,
   "text": "That's supply arc evidence. Who pays? Council and care employers who need application in the applicant's own words, it never screens, ranks or submit anything."
  }
 ],
